{"id": 14204, "title": "How is it going recently?", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK1"], "slug": "how-is-it-going-recently", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/14204_how-is-it-going-recently.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["A：李老师，好久不见！", "B：乐乐妈妈，好久不见！", "A：乐乐最近在学校怎么样？", "B：他喜欢帮助大家，同学们也很喜欢他，但是最近学习马马虎虎。", "A：他学习不努力，每天回家就喜欢看电视。", "B：看太多电视不好。", "A：是呀。我说了，他不听。", "B：明天他来学校，我也跟他说说这个事。", "A：太好了！谢谢李老师。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["A：李老師，好久不見！", "B：樂樂媽媽，好久不見！", "A：樂樂最近在學校怎麼樣？", "B：他喜歡幫助大家，同學們也很喜歡他，但是最近學習馬馬虎虎。", "A：他學習不努力，每天回家就喜歡看電視。", "B：看太多電視不好。", "A：是呀。我說了，他不聽。", "B：明天他來學校，我也跟他說說這個事。", "A：太好了！謝謝李老師。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["A： Lǐ lǎo shī， hǎo jiǔ bù jiàn！", "B： Lè lè mā ma， hǎo jiǔ bù jiàn！", "A： Lè lè zuì jìn zài xué xiào zěn me yàng？", "B： tā xǐ huan bāng zhù dà jiā， tóng xué men yě hěn xǐ huan tā， dàn shì zuì jìn xué xí mǎ ma hū hū。", "A： tā xué xí bù nǔ lì， měi tiān huí jiā jiù xǐ huan kàn diàn shì。", "B： kàn tài duō diàn shì bù hǎo。", "A： shì ya。 wǒ shuō le， tā bù tīng。", "B： míng tiān tā lái xué xiào， wǒ yě gēn tā shuō shuō zhè gè shì。", "A： tài hǎo le！ xiè xie Lǐ lǎo shī。"], "english_paragraphs": ["A: Teacher Li, long time no see!", "B: Lele’s mother, long time no see!", "A: How is Lele doing at school recently?", "B: He likes to help everyone, and his classmates also like him very much, but his studies have been so-so recently.", "A: He doesn’t study hard and likes to watch TV every day when he comes home.", "B: Watching too much TV is not good.", "A: Yes. I told him, but he didn't listen.", "", "A: Great! Thank you, Teacher Li."], "english_full": "A: Teacher Li, long time no see!\n\nB: Lele’s mother, long time no see!\n\nA: How is Lele doing at school recently?\n\nB: He likes to help everyone, and his classmates also like him very much, but his studies have been so-so recently.\n\nA: He doesn’t study hard and likes to watch TV every day when he comes home.\n\nB: Watching too much TV is not good.\n\nA: Yes. I told him, but he didn't listen.\n\n\n\nA: Great! Thank you, Teacher Li.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">A</span><span class=\"tr\">A</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Lǐ\" data-defn=\"surname Li\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">李</span><span class=\"tr\">李</span><rt>Lǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǎo shī\" data-defn=\"teacher\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hǎo\" data-defn=\"(before an adjective for exclamatory effect) so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiǔ\" data-defn=\"(of a period of time) long\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">久</span><span class=\"tr\">久</span><rt>jiǔ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù\" data-defn=\"no; not so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiàn\" data-defn=\"to see / to meet / to appear (to be sth) / to interview\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">见</span><span class=\"tr\">見</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby>！", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">B</span><span class=\"tr\">B</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Lè lè\" data-defn=\"a personal name or nickname, often transliterated as Lele\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">乐乐</span><span class=\"tr\">樂樂</span><rt>Lè lè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mā ma\" data-defn=\"mama / mommy / mother\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā ma</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hǎo\" data-defn=\"(before an adjective for exclamatory effect) so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data